C-B509-7AB8117C41AA", "text": "正在使用工具：生成任务\n参数\n{\"user_input\": \"基于近3天健康数据生成3个健康任务：1. 今日补足步数至8000步；2. 记录至少2餐饮食摄入；3. 今晚保证连续睡眠时长不少于7小时\"}\n\n输出\n已根据描述生成 1 条待确认任务「步数」。请在消息内任务卡片中确认或忽略。", "anchor": {"value": "call_3flbll38yszu72kobsj19pao", "type": "toolCall"}, "updated_at": "2026-05-18T07:23:52.000Z", "created_at": "2026-05-18T07:23:50.000Z"}, {"kind": "taskCards", "tool_call_id": "call_3flbll38yszu72kobsj19pao", "id": "D3E76E65-0E31-47AF-A3AE-5B0E1E0467EA", "anchor": {"value": "call_3flbll38yszu72kobsj19pao", "type": "toolCall"}, "updated_at": "2026-05-18T07:23:52.000Z", "task_cards": [{"business_id": "", "business_type": "ai_task_generation", "id": -1779089032, "created_at": "2026-05-18T07:23:52.000Z", "due_time": "2026-05-19T07:23:52.000Z", "ignored_reason": "", "status": 0, "member": 10, "title": "步数", "start_time": "2026-05-18T07:23:52.000Z", "similarity_payload": {"member_source": "thread_member_binding", "queried_first": "true", "similar_count": "0"}, "priority": 1, "description": "目标：步数\n动作：中等强度运动\n计划：daily\n强度：8000步", "type": 1, "source": 1, "updated_at": "2026-05-18T07:23:52.000Z", "repeat_type": 0, "extract_payload": {"period": "", "start_time": "", "task_type": "exercise", "intensity_or_value": "8000步", "confidence": "0.55", "target_metric": "步数", "action": "", "frequency": ""}, "task_payload": {"task": "{\"creator_id\":\"current_user\",\"status\":0,\"source\":1,\"priority\":1,\"type\":1,\"start_time\":\"2026-05-18T07:23:52.284Z\",\"member_id\":10,\"due_time\":\"2026-05-19T07:23:52.284Z\",\"repeat_type\":0}", "task_exercise": "{\"exercise_type\":\"中等强度运动\",\"duration_min\":8000,\"intensity\":\"medium\",\"description\":\"步数\"}"}}], "created_at": "2026-05-18T07:23:52.000Z"}, {"kind": "tool", "tool_name": "ask_user_question", "tool_call_id": "call_frtqldyn03zjgwdeiclfcog5", "id": "54DC46ED-6537-4DA0-9E39-30F6F15D0928", "text": "正在使用工具：询问用户\n参数\n{\"question\": \"请选择你想要执行的健康任务\", \"options\": [\"今日补足步数至8000步\", \"记录至少2餐饮食摄入\", \"今晚保证连续睡眠时长不少于7小时\"], \"selection